      "text": "<div>Hello&nbsp;<a href=\"#\" data-vss-mention=\"version:2.0,00d0fa42-4646-6dc6-a7a1-57f2cb433b8b\">@Anna Tran</a></div><div><br></div><div>cc:&nbsp;<a href=\"#\" data-vss-mention=\"version:2.0,2fb9d723-ee0c-6a12-a65a-3f9b4ab804ad\">@Hammad Rauf</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"#\" data-vss-mention=\"version:2.0,ac0e3b74-ab66-4ec3-bacc-7e99ce316165\">@Danh Nguyen Thanh</a> </div><div><br></div><div>Fix related to this work item has been deployed to FAT environment, please verify:</div><div><br></div><div>This is my attendance from 28/09 to 04/10. As you can see, I have an approved leave on 28th September.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://dev.azure.com/gemseducation/c153c9a8-3abc-4dd1-b615-03f718b00c76/_apis/wit/attachments/42f8803f-05d4-4fa0-a5a1-fe234c35a24c?fileName=image.png\" alt=Image><br></div><div><br></div><div>Then I wanted to cancel my leave on Sep 28, so I did</div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://dev.azure.com/gemseducation/c153c9a8-3abc-4dd1-b615-03f718b00c76/_apis/wit/attachments/00c45b42-ea7a-4591-a8b6-f156e4149c17?fileName=image.png\" alt=Image><br></div><div><br></div><div>Then I went to F&amp;O to approve this request</div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://dev.azure.com/gemseducation/c153c9a8-3abc-4dd1-b615-03f718b00c76/_apis/wit/attachments/a5670949-7da5-48b9-b2b9-c90012b832d1?fileName=image.png\" alt=Image><br></div><div><br></div><div>As a result, cancelled leave does not appear on WebESS as approved leave anymore</div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://dev.azure.com/gemseducation/c153c9a8-3abc-4dd1-b615-03f718b00c76/_apis/wit/attachments/b04ac575-f2be-4458-9ddd-3a0047e7c76e?fileName=image.png\" alt=Image><br></div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://dev.azure.com/gemseducation/c153c9a8-3abc-4dd1-b615-03f718b00c76/_apis/wit/attachments/8c7917dd-2b32-4385-a2f0-a0dcf980151e?fileName=image.png\" alt=Image><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>",
